  "label": "Beach Relaxation",
  "description": "The setting of a beach is culturally associated with relaxation, leisure, and escape from daily stress. The juxtaposition of this serene environment with the text expressing physical exhaustion creates a humorous contrast. This cultural association is key to understanding the meme’s intent — the relief of needing a break is amplified by the idyllic beach setting.",
